WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:07.190
Please look! Hakkei Island is over there!

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.650
Eh?

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:09.440
Over there!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:13.570
Hakkeyoi-oink... Hakkeyoi-oink...

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.740
Oink... Oink...

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.410
Hakkeyoi-oink... Hakkei Island-oink...

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.540
So what's up with Hakkei Island?

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.330
I've been thinking of what we could do as detectives.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.840
The student council president said "There's going to be a pavilion erected at the academy",

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.090
so that means...!

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.550
Just build it somewhere else, right?

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:34.340
I see!

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.930
That island would be perfect for it!

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.810
But someone owns that island, don't they?

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.690
Think they'd give away the deed and seal just like that?

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.020
Would they?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.730
I see! Beads and eels, huh?

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.190
<i>Deed</i> and <i>seal!</i>

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.320
Okay, let's get on this mud boat and head out!

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.120
Ooh, this mud boat looks pretty good.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.830
Hop in, hop in!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.040
But this is a mud boat...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.870
It's fine! This was made on Fire-Crackle Mountain!

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:11.170
It's packed with the wisdom and bravery of our ancestors from a village of old!

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.550
That's right!

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:15.260
That island!

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.340
Milky Holmes, moving out!

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.300
Yay!

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.230
Something's running away...

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:31.150
What do I spy with my little eye!? Hak-kei Is-land!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.580
This is...

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.800
We're here! Hakkei Island!

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.680
See? The mud boat was fine! And that's how we'll go back too!

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.050
Thank you, ancestors!

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.430
Ah, wisdom and bravery~

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:08.390
Sea cucumbers...

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.480
Sea cucumbers!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.900
They're everywhere...

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.900
High-quality ingredients, yum!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.870
Bow down to me!

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.710
Suspicious people!

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.370
Lock 'em up!!

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.630
Dark! Scary!

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.800
What the heck!?

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:42.430
Um...

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.760
Please don't go!!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.970
Why'd this happen!?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.350
Dark!!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.270
Have you looked around you...

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.860
Have you!?

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.080
Now that you're here,

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.500
you'll never see the light of day again!!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.210
This is the island of despair!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.250
Hakkei Island Sea Prison!!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.130
No!!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.490
Get a hold of yourself!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.650
Settle down!

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.490
So dark...

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.530
So lonely here...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.160
W-Why did this happen to us!? We only wanted to...

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.000
<i>In order to protect the academy...</i>

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.420
<i>Do you know what could be done?</i>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.880
I thought we'd be able to protect our academy by having the pavilion built here instead!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:03.130
We only came to steal the deed and seal! What's with this messed up island!?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.390
I can't take any more of this horrifying island!!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.680
I wonder if we'll be stuck here for the rest of our lives...

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.100
Why is this island so messed up!?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.100
I feel so sorry for all the people here!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.110
Oh, beautiful me!

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.110
What did Milky Holmes come here for again?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.290
The legend of Hakkei Island?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:36.130
Yes. Apparently there is an ultimate treasure of hope that's on this island of despair.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.540
Oh? Hakkei Island, huh?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:43.090
Does it have beautiful jewels? Or is it an elegant work of art?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.510
The ultimate treasure among despair...

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.050
We shall obtain it.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.270
Could those brats have caught on Arsène-sama's plan!?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.350
Not even if pigs flew.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.860
Figures.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.400
Even so, we mustn't let anyone interfere with our plan.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.900
Have you figured out where the ultimate treasure is?

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.160
It's really hard!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:27.050
Thirty years of sea cucumbers we have gathered...

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:36.560
Pain... Despair... Pain... Despair...

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:46.150
Pain... Despair... Repeat above...

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:58.080
I can't... I can't... I can't handle any of this...

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:07.930
Sea cucumbers... Sea cucumbers... Gather them all...

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:15.850
We dry them, then export them to Chinatown for sale~

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:19.980
It's a high-quality ingredient, you see~

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.320
Eww, eww!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:32.240
Ahaha, I'm in a pwetty fwawer gaaden wight now!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.950
Sea cucumber! Sea cucumber! Sea cucumber!!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.510
The sea cucumbers are really heavy...

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.800
Herc, I'll put my share in with yours.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:52.970
Hey!!

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.520
I'm so perfect.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.690
Deed and seal!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.940
There sure is a lot of them here...

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.480
We're not even denting the number.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.570
Ow! What was that for!?

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.860
Can't you recognize us, you idiot!?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.030
Just disappear...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.000
That legend's ultimate treasure?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.540
Oh, I think I've heard about it before.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.380
Someone here knew all about it... Who was it again?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.630
Is that story true?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.930
Anyone! Does anyone know about the legend of the ultimate treasure?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.050
Even though this is the island of despair...

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:38.220
There's hope right before us...

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.020
She's wonderful!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.230
She looks so healthy! Share her with me!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.270
A sight for sore eyes...

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.230
Necklace made from sea cucumbers!

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.360
Here's lard-oink!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:50.860
Anyone...

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.530
Even if you've only heard of it, please...

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.530
Tell me about it.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.450
Anyone?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.370
Hey! Don't come any closer to her!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.960
Do any of you even know!?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.010
Ooh, you can hammer nails with the sea cucumbers!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.260
You shouldn't hammer nails there...

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:15.140
Well, it's not exactly what you wanted to hear,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:19.180
but I do know that there used to be someone that knew of the legend here.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.770
But he's already made his escape a long time ago...

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.350
Is that true?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.770
That means escaping isn't impossible!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:30.860
You did it, Miss Perfect! Now we can all escape from here!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.030
Excuse me...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.490
What's that!?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.040
Giant dried sea cucumber?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.120
Boil it in hot water!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.670
A little early, but in you go!

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.340
Ahh, what a nice bath!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.800
Hey, it's not a sea cucumber!

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.390
Who!?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.890
Some unknown old geezer!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:03.520
If it isn't our boss! Didn't you escape a long time ago?

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:08.650
Oh, I gave up on that and hid myself in here.
Before I knew it, I had been dried.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:10.480
You weren't able to escape?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:16.320
Well, you know, there's giant walls with guards around the island. There's just no way.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.330
So we really can't run away from this island, huh?

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.410
Is there no hope for us?

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.700
Oh, I know!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:31.840
That day I tried to run away, I hid myself in the security station.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:36.050
On the wall, there hung this tacky tapestry, and I saw this on it:

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.970
"To its east brims a fountain azure, to its west lie beautiful fields of verdant,

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:46.810
branches laden with oranges to its south, and peaches bloom in the lands to its north... Therein lies hope."

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.520
Hope?

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.440
Hope?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.980
Hope? What's hope?

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.030
I'm sick of dried sea cucumbers... I wanna go home and take a bath...

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.740
That must be it! Once we get the beads and eels, we can get out of here!

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.990
This is as far as I'll go!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.290
Grab hold of hope, young ones!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.710
Boss~!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.920
I'll go and look for this "hope". Looks like you lot are interested, too.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.890
Of course! We want to go too!

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:23.140
I'd rather fight as Jeanne d'Arc than as a dried-up detective!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.810
My hope! My hope!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.970
W-We'll try our best!

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.850
Can you keep up with me?

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:28.890
Yes we can!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.900
I'll go too! I don't want my boss's sacrifice to be in vain!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.070
I'll pray for your luck!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:34.860
Bored?

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:35.650
Yep.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.490
Let's go and find our hope!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.950
Yeah!!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:57.880
Order!!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.300
Hey!!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.180
No panicking!!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.970
Everyone...

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.980
Get to your stations!!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.560
Don't let any one of them...

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.150
...get close to hope, you hear me!?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.530
Wait for us!

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:23.240
There, caught up!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.870
Execution time, start!!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.080
Hiyah!

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.130
Oh no!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.340
Sher!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.550
Beauty rescue!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.260
Everyone!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.590
Beauti-fall!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.890
Ow! What the hell!?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.640
Looks like we're underwater...

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:52.020
Eww, there's a scary thing there!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.440
Don't look!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.770
Don't use me as a shield!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.820
D-Don't push me!!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:05.070
Sea cucumber room! Dark room! Creepy guy!

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.700
Yes, I'll allow it!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.830
My dear sea cucumbers!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.160
Beautiful!!

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.510
Cordelia-san! Herc-san! Nero!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.550
Fools!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.510
Two left, eh? You must have good luck...

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.560
But this is the end for you!!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.270
What's that switch for?

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.230
Bright... Hot...

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.610
Where am I?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:46.820
Hakkei Island of Despair's lowest level, Hell's Execution Ring!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:47.950
Wait...

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.290
So if it's the lowest level, it must be the newest, right?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.870
It just means the lowest level!!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:58.460
Interrupting me with worthless chat is unforgivable!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:02.710
I'll crush any hope you have left to pieces!!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.010
We won't lose when it comes to hope!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.510
Miss Perfect, let's team up on him!

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:09.930
Miss Perfect?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.180
You're more than enough for him.

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:14.310
Eh!? No fair!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.060
It'll be fine...

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.980
...if you remember what you've forgotten.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:30.410
Please wait! My friend who won against a giant squid before should almost be here!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.660
Pig snout!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.830
Stop that!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:36.790
Bastard!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.710
Hey, hold it!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:46.680
S-Sea... Sea, sea, sea cucumbers...

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.850
Climbing the ladder of adultery, oh yeah~

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:03.480
Grains... Grumble... Lumps... Mutter... Bumps...

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:07.200
It's cold, Beautiful You... It's cold...

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.990
Looks like everything's cleaned up now!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:11.450
Thanks, Mr. Jailer!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.120
If I get done in here...

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.000
I won't be able to make hope mine!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.590
Come back, my Toys!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.220
That wasn't a Toys.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.520
You're no match for me!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.860
It's no use... I surrend―

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.270
Are you going to give up on hope!?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.530
<i>No... I have to find hope!</i>

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:52.570
I have to save everyone, or we won't be able to see our academy again!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:56.240
What, is that all you've got!?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.120
No, I won't give up on hope!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.580
I will never surrender!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.300
Then this is the end for you!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.760
Slip!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.090
Flip!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.430
Plunge!!

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.810
Even the toughest of octopuses will turn deliciously boiled!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.810
No!!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.770
It's done!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:25.230
Miss Perfect, I did it!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.820
Boiled octopus, oh yeah!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.860
I thought something smelled good. So it was this, huh?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.450
Everyone!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:32.200
Sher!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.370
So everyone was safe!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.700
Thank goodness.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.200
I'll have some octopus, too!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.790
Yummy!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:38.540
So much...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.000
Enough for four people, right?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.380
You actually made me stand on solid ground...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.210
You're no ordinary brats, are you!?

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.970
That's right.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.840
Okay, that's enough. Listen to me.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.800
You, there. You over here. You, over there. You, there.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.980
Sherlock Shellingford, pink!

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.610
Yuzurizaki Nero, yellow!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.610
Hercule Barton, green!

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.740
Cordelia Glauca, blue!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.580
The detectives of Milky Holmes, present!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.750
Detectives!?

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:32.380
<i>"To its east brims a fountain azure, to its west lie... Uh...</i>

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.590
<i>"Therein lies hope!"</i>

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.430
NO!!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.450
This is...

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.410
A lisianthus...

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.910
In floriography, it means "hope"...

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.460
This is the treasure?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.550
We've wasted our time.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.930
Let's go.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.100
This is where the treasure is!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.150
Don't leave me behind!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.610
A flower!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:30.980
Lisianthus...

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.280
In the language of flowers, it means "hope".

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.280
That's it! That's what hope is!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:38.280
So this is hope!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.200
Pretty...

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:45.000
I can hear this flower's message. It says that beautiful flowers can grow anywhere!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.000
Where's the deed? Where's the seal?

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.380
Sea cucumbers are gushing out!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:00.800
This island was made out of dried sea cucumbers?

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.260
I've had enough of sea cucumbers...

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.020
The ground is crumbling!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.190
Fools!!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.310
Look!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.270
The sea cucumbers made a path to the mainland!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.440
We can escape from here!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.740
Food-oink!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.200
Yahoo!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.700
Okay, everyone! Let's go to a world of hope and freedom!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.120
And?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:31.880
We let the poor-looking people captured by the bad-looking people escape!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.590
That's because we're detectives!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.840
I've got a gift for you.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.470
Here, a flower of hope!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.760
Hope?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.140
Worthless...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.430
We're at the scene.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:47.480
The prisoners who escaped from Hakkei Island Sea Prison have set fire to the whole of Yokohama!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.440
"Prison" means a jail.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.150
Eh?

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:58.280
The island you destroyed was Yokohama's prison, and those "poor-looking people" are its prisoners.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.830
Everything about you as detectives―No, as people―is completely wrong.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:10.540
G4 put forth tremendous effort in capturing all of the runaway prisoners!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.040
Thanks to G4, Yokohama is once again at peace! And with no casualties!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.420
As expected of G4!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:22.430
Why did detectives let prisoners escape!?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:26.430
You really are the most retarded of the retarded!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:30.140
Well, at least <i>moi</i>, with an IQ of 140,000 and the rest of G4 at my disposal,

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.850
was there to beautifully save the day for you!

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.400
I'm sorry!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.150
You can repent there for life!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.280
Share some made-up sea cucumbers while you're at it!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:49.160
Cordelia, you sleep too weird! You keep pushing and kicking me every night!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.620
Also, don't put roses on the bed!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:54.790
I'm having a vivid vision of a beautiful bed of roses!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.670
Your stupid long hair keeps poking me! It hurts!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.130
Just think of it like having acupuncture!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.470
It's nothing compared to the beautiful thorns of roses!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.970
How is that supposed to help me!? I want a bigger bed!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.890
A bigger bed... Sounds nice!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.220
More dreams... More, more!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.560
Next time: The Sleeping Postures of Milky Holmes.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.560
The culprit is Cordelia! Cordelia!
